5.1 Fees. Licensee shall pay the fees set out in the applicable order, invoice, or published price list ("Fees"). Fees are payable in advance for each Subscription Term.

5.2 Taxes and VAT. Fees are exclusive of VAT and any other applicable taxes or duties, which will be added where required. Where Licensee is a business established in an EU Member State other than Licensor's, Licensee shall provide a valid VAT identification number, and the reverse charge mechanism will apply. Licensee is responsible for the accuracy of any VAT number provided and for any liability arising from an invalid number.

5.3 Automatic renewal. Unless cancelled before the end of the current Subscription Term, subscriptions renew automatically for successive periods of equal length at the then-current price. Licensee may cancel renewal at any time through the customer portal.

5.4 Price changes. Licensor may change prices for renewal terms on not less than thirty (30) days' written notice before the renewal date. If Licensee does not accept the change, Licensee may cancel renewal before the renewal date.

5.5 Late payment. Overdue amounts bear interest at the rate provided by applicable law on late payment in commercial transactions, calculated from the due date until payment.

